# Strict ingest admits an entry whose stamp the receiver's own catalog cannot
# serve, as if the source region's definitions applied.
MODULE: StrictAdmitsOnlyServableIgnoresCatalog
TARGET: StrictAdmitsOnlyServable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: strict ingest skips the receiver's decodability check
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
            THEN /\ IF Servable(stamp[e]) /\ body[e] = "Good"
--- REPLACE
            THEN /\ IF body[e] = "Good"
--- END
